+V40,IMPL,3,V40/contract/api/rhsm-subscriptions-api-spec.yaml:1703;V40/impl/src/main/java/org/candlepin/subscriptions/resource/InstancesResource.java:215;V40/impl/swatch-core/src/main/java/org/candlepin/subscriptions/db/model/TallyInstanceView.java:78;V40/impl/swatch-core/src/main/java/org/candlepin/subscriptions/db/model/InstanceMonthlyTotalKey.java:44,"⚠️ Monthly totals are keyed by month and unit, but conversion ignores those keys, takes an arbitrary first value, and zeroes other units. This can misstate measurements; positional correspondence requires selecting the relevant stored total."
